  "description": "Compact and ready to explore. This bike gives you all the practicality of Brompton, lightweight, folding and portable, in a beautiful nature-inspired package. The durable hand-built frame is finished in soft, delicate tones of pink with an individual flower on the head badge. We selected proven components to deliver you swiftly, safely and in style from your apartment to meet-ups and gatherings. The six gears cover all situations, from short, flat rides to explorations further afield. Super puncture-resistant Schwalbe Almotion tires happily roll from road to pebble path.\nRefinement is showcased in every element of this versatile bike. Promising a smooth ride, the 6-gearing system and powerful brakes ensure control and precision can be enjoyed. This makes for a comfortable riding experience which gives you the time to enjoy the special things in life.",
